meta {
  name: DPoP client lookup (sg-dpop)
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/admin/realms/{{realm}}/clients?clientId=sg-dpop
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{adminToken}}
}

docs {
  Mirrors run-live-lanes.sh:266 - the admin-API read the lane uses to find the
  seeded confidential client. Expect sg-dpop with dpop.bound.access.tokens
  true and the two hardcoded-claim mappers (tid=master, roles=service). The
  lane's POSTs that create the client and mappers are mutations and stay in
  the script, not here.
}
